<hr />
<span id="Upravlenie-paketami"></span><h2 class="chapter">2 Управление пакетами</h2>

<span id="index-packaging"></span>

<p>This chapter is dedicated to teaching you how to add packages to the
collection of packages that come with GNU Guix.  This involves writing
package definitions in Guile Scheme, organizing them in package modules, and
building them.
</p>

